[95.05487, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[95.095354, "o", "usage: explore.py [-h] [--model MODEL] {model,next,history} ...\r\n\r\nLook inside a local model (M1 lab, part 1). Changes nothing.\r\n\r\npositional arguments:\r\n  {model,next,history}\r\n    model               what the model file is\r\n    next                next-token prediction, step by step\r\n    history             the app re-sends the chat history\r\n\r\noptions:\r\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\r\n  --model MODEL         model name (default gemma3:1b)\r\n"]
