[163.642144, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[163.971768, "o", "text so far: \"The capital of France is\"\r\nThe model reads all of it, scores every token it knows, and the top guess is added. Then again.\r\n\r\nstep 1: picks ' Paris'     top 3 guesses: ' Paris' 93.8%  ' **'  1.8%  ' a'  0.6%\r\nstep 2: picks '.'          top 3 guesses: '.' 97.9%  ','  1.9%  '?'  0.2%\r\nstep 3: picks '\\n\\n'       top 3 guesses: '\\n\\n' 80.3%  '\\n'  7.7%  ' The'  5.4%\r\nstep 4: picks 'The'        top 3 guesses: 'The' 54.2%  'It' 18.2%  'What'  3.4%\r\nstep 5: picks ' largest'   top 3 guesses: ' largest' 44.1%  ' population'  8.2%  ' city'  7.6%\r\nstep 6: picks ' city'      top 3 guesses: ' city' 97.2%  ' country'  1.6%  ' ocean'  0.4%\r\n\r\nresult: \"The capital of France is Paris.\r\n\r\nThe largest city\"\r\n(6 tokens, one per step. temperature 0 = always take the top guess.)\r\n"]
[163.981017, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m01\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m01\u001b[00m$ "]
