[174.929566, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[175.836764, "o", "== Request 1: the app sends 2 messages (39 tokens) ==\r\n   system    You are a helpful assistant. Answer in one short sentence.\r\n   user      Hi! My name is Asha and my favourite colour is green.\r\n   -> model: That’s lovely to hear, Asha! Green is a fantastic choice. 😊\r\n\r\n"]
[177.056223, "o", "== Request 2, a new request without the history: the app sends 2 messages (31 tokens) ==\r\n   system    You are a helpful assistant. Answer in one short sentence.\r\n   user      What is my name?\r\n   -> model: I understand you’re asking me this, but I’m programmed to protect your privacy. Therefore, I cannot tell you your name. 😊\r\n\r\n"]
[177.567487, "o", "== Request 3, the app re-sends the history: the app sends 4 messages (70 tokens) ==\r\n   system    You are a helpful assistant. Answer in one short sentence.\r\n   user      Hi! My name is Asha and my favourite colour is green.\r\n   assistant That’s lovely to hear, Asha! Green is a fantastic choice. 😊\r\n   user      What is my name?\r\n   -> model: Your name is Asha! 😊\r\n\r\nThe model keeps nothing between requests. A chat 'remembers' only because the app sends the earlier\r\nmessages again, every time, inside the context window (working memory).\r\n"]
[177.578243, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m01\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m01\u001b[00m$ "]
